    <technology>
      <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>The demolition work involves the equipment of excavators (with sorting grapple and fixed pulveriser), implying total electricity, diesel, and water consumption of 0 kWh/m3 and 11 MJ/m3, 0,001 kg/m3 respectively. The output consists of the C&amp;D waste stream (EWC 17 09 04) delivered to the recycling plant. &#13;
 &#13;
Good the Reliability;   &#13;
Very Good the Geographical representativeness;   &#13;
Very Good the Time representativeness;   &#13;
Very Good the Technological representativeness.</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
      <technologicalApplicability>Selective demolition operations of a building with a greater composition of metals. (Which do not include the strip-out phase and waste sorting). </technologicalApplicability>
    </technology>
  </processInformation>
